PT","  あなたは脳科学と学習心理学に詳しい学習伴走コーチです。","  以下のタスクを、記憶の定着と理解度を高めるための「スモールステップ」に分解してください。","","  タスク名: #{@task.name}","  タスクの概要・詳細: #{task_desc_str}","  締め切り: #{due_date_str}","  今日の日付: #{today_str}","","  【指示事項】","  ・「アクティブリコール（自分で思い出す作業）」や「ファインマン・テクニック（自分の言葉で説明してみる作業）」など、科学的に効果の高い学習プロセスをステップ内に自然に組み込んでください。","  ・3〜5個の具象的で小さなステップを提案してください。","  ・各ステップの期限は、今日（#{today_str}）から締め切り（#{due_date_str}）までの期間で現実的に設定してください。","","  【出力フォーマット】","  ### ステップ1: （ステップ名）","  **期限:** （YYYY年M月D日）","  （詳細の説明文。「〇〇を何も見ずに思い出す」「自分の言葉で1文にまとめる」などの具体的な行動を1〜2文で記述。）","","  ### ステップ2: （ステップ名）","  **期限:** （YYYY年M月D日）","  （詳細の説明文。1〜2文。）","PROMPT"]}],[{"start":{"row":239,"column":0},"end":{"row":254,"column":3},"action":"remove","lines":["post '/tasks/:id/toggle' do","  require_login","  task = current_user.tasks.find_by(id: params[:id])","  if task","    new_completed = !task.completed","    task.update(completed: new_completed)","    # 完了にしたとき +10pt、未完了に戻したとき -10pt（0以下にはしない）","    if new_completed","      current_user.add_points(10)","    else","      current_user.update(points: [current_user.points - 10, 0].max)","    end","  end","  content_type :json","  { completed: task&.completed, points: current_user.points }.to_json","end"],"id":24},{"start":{"row":239,"column":0},"end":{"row":273,"column":3},"action":"insert","lines":["post '/tasks/:id/toggle' do","  require_login","  task = current_user.tasks.find_by(id: params[:id])","  if task","    new_completed = !task.completed","    task.update(completed: new_completed)","","    # 完了にしたとき +10pt、未完了に戻したとき -10pt（0以下にはしない）","    if new_completed","      current_user.add_points(10)","","      # ----------------------------------------------------","      # 【分散学習】1日後・3日後・7日後の復習タスクを自動生成","      # ----------------------------------------------------","      # 復習タスク自体の完了時に再生成されないよう「【復習】」から始まらないものだけ対象にする","      unless task.name.start_with?('【復習】')","        [1, 3, 7].each do |days|","          current_user.tasks.create(","            name: \"【復習】#{task.name}（#{days}日目）\",","            description: \"忘却曲線に基づいた復習です。何も見ずに内容を思い出す（アクティブリコール）を試してみましょう！\\n元タスク: #{task.name}\",","            due_date: Date.today + days,","            parent_task_id: task.id,","            color: task.color","          )","        end","      end","      # ----------------------------------------------------","","    else","      current_user.update(points: [current_user.points - 10, 0].max)","    end","  end","  content_type :json","  { completed: task&.completed, points: current_user.points }.to_json","end"]}],[{"start":{"row":171,"column":0},"end":{"row":182,"column":0},"action":"remove","lines":["get '/mypage' do","  require_login","  @user = current_user","  # 親タスクのみ（parent_task_id が nil）を登録日の新しい順に取得する","  # 子タスクは parent_task_id が設定されているので除外","  @parent_tasks = current_user.tasks","    .where(parent_task_id: nil)","    .order(created_at: :desc)","    .includes(:child_tasks)","  erb :mypage","end",""],"id":25},{"start":{"row":171,"column":0},"end":{"row":186,"column":3},"action":"insert","lines":["get '/mypage' do","  require_login","  @user = current_user","  ","  # 親タスク一覧","  @parent_tasks = current_user.tasks","    .where(parent_task_id: nil)","    .order(created_at: :desc)","    .includes(:child_tasks)","","  # 【追加】今日が締め切り（または今日やるべき）未完了タスクを取得","  @today_tasks = current_user.tasks","    .where(due_date: Date.today, completed: false)","","  erb :mypage","end"]}],[{"start":{"row":397,"column":0},"end":{"row":399,"column":69},"action":"insert","lines":["・「毎日25語進める」のような継続タスクの場合、「1日目」「2日目」と大雑把にせず、","            今日から締め切りまでの「実際の各日付（例: 2026年9月1日、2026年9月2日…）」ごとに、","            その日にやるべき具体行動（例: 「1〜25語目を暗記」「26〜50語目を暗記」）へ細かく分解して出力してください。"],"id":27}],[{"start":{"row":397,"column":0},"end":{"row":397,"column":1},"action":"insert","lines":[" "],"id":28},{"start":{"row":397,"column":1},"end":{"row":397,"column":2},"action":"insert","lines":[" "]}],[{"start":{"row":398,"column":10},"end":{"row":398,"column":12},"action":"remove","lines":["  "],"id":29},{"star